[agent:result]        --worker-pool-spec=[WORKER_POOL_SPEC,...]
[agent:result]           Define the worker pool configuration used by the custom job. You can
[agent:result]           specify multiple worker pool specs in order to create a custom job
[agent:result]           with multiple worker pools.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]           The spec can contain the following fields:
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]            machine-type
[agent:result]               (Required): The type of the machine. see
